This ability frenzies your current target with your primary and optionally secondary weapon, then attacks an additional time with each weapon in a frenzy of attacks. Reduces the cooldown time of the Rampage AA.

Frenzy will double and triple attack based on your skill

Macro command: /doability Frenzy

